From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Can Oguz <can.oguz@nodos.dev>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 12:32:53 +0300
Subject: Send fenced offscreen frames when Chromium queues the copy

GPU consumers can wait for the capture on their own command queue.
Export the D3D11 producer fence with the pooled texture after
submission and keep the existing capture release callback in force.

Job-Id: accelerate-electronode-texture-handoff

